#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:131
msgid ""
"With per-model virtual environments enabled, Xinference 3.0 automatically"
" selects the matching ``xllamacpp`` GPU wheel for supported CUDA "
"versions; see :ref:`user_guide_backends`. For a manual installation into "
"the process environment, refer to https://github.com/xorbitsai/xllamacpp."
msgstr "啟用個別模型虛擬環境後，Xinference 3.0 會為支援的 CUDA 版本自動選擇相符的 ``xllamacpp`` GPU wheel；請參閱 :ref:`user_guide_backends`。若要手動安裝到程序環境中，請參閱 https://github.com/xorbitsai/xllamacpp。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:137
msgid "SGLang Backend"
msgstr "SGLang 引擎"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:138
msgid ""
"SGLang has a high-performance inference runtime with RadixAttention. It "
"significantly accelerates the execution of complex LLM programs by "
"automatic KV cache reuse across multiple calls. And it also supports "
"other common techniques like continuous batching and tensor parallelism."
msgstr ""
"SGLang 具有基於 RadixAttention 的高效能推理執行時間。它透過在多個呼叫之間自動重用 KV "
"快取，顯著加速了複雜 LLM 程式的執行。它也支援其他常見推理技術，如連續批次處理和張量平行處理"
"。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:146
msgid "MLX Backend"
msgstr "MLX 引擎"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:147
msgid "MLX-lm is designed for Apple silicon users to run LLM efficiently."
msgstr "MLX-lm 用來在蘋果 Silicon 晶片上提供高效的 LLM 推理。"

